BASE="Professional photographic character reference sheet, 3 rows x 4 columns grid on a seamless light grey studio background, soft even studio lighting, ultra realistic candid photography, real skin texture with visible pores and natural imperfections, not airbrushed, not CGI, shot on 85mm. The same single person in all 12 panels, consistent identity. Wearing a plain heather grey crew-neck t-shirt, grey trousers and grey shoes, no logos, no accessories. Row 1 head and shoulders: front, three-quarter, side profile, back of head. Row 2 head and shoulders expressions: neutral, gentle smile, genuine laughing, listening attentively. Row 3 full body, head to toe, feet fully visible inside the frame with floor space below: front, three-quarter, side profile, back."
