LATINO="Chilean, clearly Latin American and NOT Nordic, NOT Scandinavian, slightly rounded facial structure, nose slightly wider than a Nordic type."
M1="Subject: a Chilean mother, of Spanish descent, light skin with warm golden undertone, $LATINO Warm dark brown eyes, natural brows. Shoulder-length dark chestnut brown hair with soft natural waves and subtle warm caramel highlights. Light natural makeup, tiny stud earrings. Warm, approachable, everyday mom. $ADULT_AGE"
