P2="Subject: a Chilean father, of Spanish and German descent, light skin with warm golden undertone, $LATINO Light brown eyes. Short medium-brown hair with a side part, clean-shaven with light five o'clock shadow. Average build, 1.80 m. Kind, easygoing dad. $ADULT_AGE"
